<div class="os-problem-container">
    <p id="import-auto-id1168465440225">(a) What is the vapor pressure of water at <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{"20" "." 0°C} {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>? (b) What percentage of atmospheric pressure does this correspond to? (c) What percent of <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{"20" "." 0°C} {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> air is water vapor if it has 100% relative humidity? (The density of dry air at <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>20</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{"20" "." 0°C} {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mtext>20</mtext><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup><mtext> kg/m</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mtext>20</mtext><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup><mtext> kg/m</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{1 "." "20"" kg/m" rSup { size 8{3} } } {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>.) </p></div>
